    "text": "goeasternoregon.com\nwebsite\nImbler\nHaunted Warehouse brings the scares in October to Imbler\nBy Go! Eastern Oregon,\n14 hours agoIMBLER — The Haunted Warehouse is back, thanks to Night Fright Productions. The scares start on Oct. 3, and run every Friday and Saturday through Oct. 31 from 7-10 p.m. The cost is $20 for all ages to experience the warehouse. New this year are two 5-minute escape rooms that cost $5 each, or try both for $8.",
